<!-- ── FOR MARKET MAKERS ──────────────────────── -->
<section id="market-makers">
    <div class="wrap--tight">
        <span class="label fu">For Market Makers</span>
        <div class="manifesto">
            <p class="manifesto-lead fu">Your project is not a commodity. It never was.</p>
            <p class="fu d1">It was built with a standard most developers in this market can't reach and most agencies can't comprehend. The comparables they pull, the pricing they accept, the buyers they attract. None of that was built for what you've created.</p>
            <p class="fu d2">Smaller developers look at your work and see where they want to be. Don't trade that down for the comfort of a familiar process.</p>
            <p class="fu d2">The agency path is easy. That's also why most projects in this market undersell.</p>
            <p class="manifesto-close fu d3">You're a Market Maker. The right sales partner doesn't undermine your project. They prove it.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    /* ─── FOR MARKET MAKERS ─────────────────────── */
